    "summary_one_sentence": "While caring for her comatose mother, a skeptical paranormal podcast host becomes haunted by a malevolent demonic entity after analyzing a set of mysterious audio recordings sent to her show.",
    "summary_short": "Evangeline 'Evy' Babic co-hosts a popular paranormal podcast where she acts as the resident skeptic dissecting bizarre supernatural claims. While caring for her comatose mother at home, she receives ten mysterious audio recordings detailing a couple's eerie nighttime experiences. As Evy and her co-host analyze the files and uncover hidden backmasked messages, a malevolent demonic entity begins invading her physical surroundings. Plagued by terrifying occurrences that mirror her personal fears, Evy must navigate an accelerating nightmare that blurs the line between sound and real-world horror.",
    "summary_long": "Evangeline 'Evy' Babic co-hosts a popular paranormal podcast with her friend Justin, playing the skeptic to his believer while caring for her comatose mother. The podcast receives an anonymous email containing ten audio files recorded by a couple documenting mysterious sounds during sleep talking. Analyzing the clips, Evy and Justin uncover unsettling hidden messages played in reverse that make reference to a menacing ancient entity. Around the same time, Evy discovers that she herself is unexpectedly pregnant, forcing her to confront her deep-seated anxieties about motherhood. As they analyze additional recordings, inexplicable phenomena begin invading Evy's isolated home, ranging from flickering lights to shifting objects. Distressing calls into the podcast reveal that the people featured in the audio met a tragic and terrifying fate. Realizing that listening to the recordings has summoned a predatory demonic presence, Evy finds herself psychologically and physically besieged in her own house. As the dark entity's influence spreads across her surroundings, the boundaries between sound and tangible nightmare shatter entirely. Trapped inside with her deteriorating mother, Evy is forced to confront the terrifying force that has attached itself to her life.",
    "synopsis": "In 'Undertone', skeptical podcast co-host Evangeline 'Evy' Babic finds her pragmatic worldview challenged while caring for her comatose mother in her childhood home. Alongside her podcasting partner Justin, Evy hosts a show dedicated to investigating paranormal claims and uncanny audio recordings. Their routine investigation takes a dark turn when they receive ten mysterious, anonymous audio files featuring a couple experiencing eerie nocturnal disturbances. As Evy dives deeper into analyzing the tapes, she uncovers unsettling subliminal messages hidden in the audio that seem directly connected to her personal life and vulnerable state. The psychological toll quickly turns into physical terror as supernatural manifestations begin haunting her home, forcing Evy to question whether the recordings are an elaborate hoax or a portal to an ancient, predatory evil.",
